  "notes": "A formal word used primarily in official, government, and news contexts. Everyday conversation typically uses {海外|かいがい}に{行|い}く instead.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {海外|かいがい}{渡航|とこう}: overseas travel\n- {渡航|とこう}{先|さき}: travel destination (abroad)\n- {渡航|とこう}{禁止|きんし}: travel ban\n- {渡航|とこう}{歴|れき}: travel history (abroad)\n- {渡航|とこう}{注意|ちゅうい}: travel advisory\n- {渡航|とこう}ビザ: travel visa\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {海外|かいがい}に{行|い}く: to go abroad — everyday expression\n- {出国|しゅっこく}する: to leave the country — focuses on the act of departure\n- {入国|にゅうこく}する: to enter a country — the opposite of {出国|しゅっこく}\n- {旅行|りょこう}する: to travel — general, not limited to overseas",
